Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.01,0:01:57.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}She lied to us.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.26,0:02:00.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}She said it was okay\Nfor us to pass through.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.30,0:02:03.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}But when we did, they\Naccused us of illegal entry?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.89,0:02:06.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's flat out fraud!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.50,0:02:08.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.09,0:02:10.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But then, even if we were\Ntold we couldn't pass,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.30,0:02:12.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we would've just forced\Nour way through.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.10,0:02:14.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, how was that little\Nold lady gonna stop us?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.56,0:02:15.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.81,0:02:17.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In any case, you're in\Na great deal of trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.56,0:02:19.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're now second-degree\Ncriminals, and as such,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:23.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid Conis and I are\Nunable to assist you any longer.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.66,0:02:26.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you talking to us\Nfrom way over there?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.38,0:02:28.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't really see\Nwhat the big deal is.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.12,0:02:31.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you're not\Nused to this by now.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.20,0:02:35.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to ask.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.21,0:02:37.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why'd you come back, Nami?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.18,0:02:38.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.26,0:02:39.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were finally gonna\Nget to set sail
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.76,0:02:42.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and head out on an amazing\Nadventure until you...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.18,0:02:44.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, we were about\Nto come looking for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.36,0:02:45.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were getting worried.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.82,0:02:49.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think you and I need\Nto have a little talk.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.10,0:02:53.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forget about your big adventure.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.81,0:02:56.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.70,0:02:58.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You haven't seen what I've seen.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.31,0:02:59.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That island is full\Nof the type of people
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.02,0:03:01.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you don't wanna mess with.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.11,0:03:02.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care who\Nyou think you are.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.94,0:03:04.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Granted, we don't know\Nwhat this guy is,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.61,0:03:05.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but his powers are real.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.03,0:03:08.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And there's no way I'm ever\Ngoin' back there again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.41,0:03:10.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So forget it. Got me?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.58,0:03:17.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How 'bout you just relax\Nhere while the rest of us go?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.17,0:03:18.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're wanted criminals!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.41,0:03:20.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not staying here a\Nminute longer, either.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.56,0:03:22.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts? Get your\Npriorities straight.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.73,0:03:25.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The adventure is always\Nthe most important part!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.44,0:03:28.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My priorities are life\Nfirst, then money.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.64,0:03:30.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please tell me I'm\Nthird on that list.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.64,0:03:31.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't push me.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.98,0:03:33.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You raise a good point.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.81,0:03:37.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We put all of our energy into\Njust trying to get up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.18,0:03:38.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But we never really\Nthought about
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.39,0:03:39.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,how we were gonna get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:41.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Suu.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.70,0:03:44.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is there a safe way back\Nto the Blue Sea World?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.79,0:03:48.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can we ever even go home again?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.17,0:03:49.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There is a way,\Nbut at this juncture,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.67,0:03:51.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's no longer safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.59,0:03:52.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your only hope for escape
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.05,0:03:54.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is to make your\Nway to Cloud End.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.51,0:03:57.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,From there you can travel home.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.21,0:04:00.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's Cloud End? And how are\Nwe supposed to get there?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.69,0:04:02.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a region\Nthat lies far to the east.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.98,0:04:04.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only way for\Nyou to get there
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.36,0:04:07.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is to travel across\Nthe White White Sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.82,0:04:08.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.07,0:04:11.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So we sail east, and we\Neventually get home!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.16,0:04:13.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I don't wanna go home.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.14,0:04:17.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your other option is stay\Nand get sentenced to death.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.14,0:04:18.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.25,0:04:19.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't want you causing\Nany more trouble
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.88,0:04:21.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for Conis and her dad.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.79,0:04:23.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. Don't worry about us.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.05,0:04:25.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if we leave right now,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.42,0:04:28.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there's no guarantee we'll\Nmake a clean escape.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.09,0:04:31.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have any time to\Nlose, so just get on the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.14,0:04:32.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll have your\Nadventure, I promise,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.81,0:04:34.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but right now, we\Nneed to get going.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.46,0:04:36.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So come on everybody.\NLet's set sail.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.60,0:04:41.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all your help!\NWe really appreciate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:42.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Hold on.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.27,0:04:45.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on! Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.49,0:04:47.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.72,0:04:48.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.99,0:04:50.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can I ask I favor?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.75,0:04:52.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya mind if we take the\Nleftovers from earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.91,0:04:54.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course not.\NThey're all yours.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.62,0:04:57.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Woohoo! Come on, Sanji!\NMake us lunch!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.62,0:04:59.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Glad you got priorities.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.12,0:05:02.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In that case, could I ask for\Na teensy little favor, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.31,0:05:04.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're an engineer, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.94,0:05:07.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose you could\Nspare any parts or tools
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.40,0:05:08.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to fix our ship?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.09,0:05:10.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's mine is yours, Usopp.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.83,0:05:12.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Feel free to take\Nanything you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:15.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, guys. Where are you going?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.91,0:05:18.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hello! They got food!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.12,0:05:21.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell ya what, you go ahead\Nand ready the ship for departure
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.26,0:05:24.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and we'll be back\Nbefore you know it.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.80,0:05:28.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's dead-set on goin'\Nto that island.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.09,0:05:29.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:32.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't take it out on us.\NYou know how he is.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.31,0:05:35.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seriously, try to relax.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.19,0:05:37.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper. You're still on\Nmy side, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.90,0:05:38.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.05,0:05:40.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:44.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Heavy point!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.92,0:05:52.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was about to drop the\Nladder for you, you know?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.92,0:05:57.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know there's no\Npersuading Luffy of anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.36,0:06:00.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He won't listen even if\Nwe all gang up on him.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.28,0:06:02.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine, then I guess\NI'll just stay put.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.07,0:06:05.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you're free to do\Nwhatever you want.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.91,0:06:07.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.90,0:06:11.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But if I stay here,\NI'll be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:14.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep. Quite a predicament.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:19.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:20.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.72,0:06:22.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go beat some\Nsense into Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.76,0:06:24.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Won't work.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.60,0:06:26.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess we'd have\Na better chance
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.89,0:06:28.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,against the White Berets.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.81,0:06:30.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you know they've\Nalready gotta be gathering
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.82,0:06:33.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,reinforcements to follow us.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.22,0:06:39.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Follow you? Idiots.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.22,0:06:42.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru and his Priests\Naren't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.25,0:06:46.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why should I bother when\Nyour true judgment awaits?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.21,0:06:49.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once you weigh anchor,\Nyour challenge will begin.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.25,0:06:51.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your ship will set\Nits own course
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.49,0:06:54.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the forbidden\NSacred Grounds.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.48,0:06:58.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Upper Yard!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.28,0:07:03.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.37,0:07:07.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Save some for the trip.\NAnd for the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:10.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's plenty here.\NWhy hold back?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.04,0:07:12.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This does have\Nto feed all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.85,0:07:14.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis! Refill!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.52,0:07:16.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get it yourself?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.53,0:07:18.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Speaking of, where is Conis?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.45,0:07:21.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think she went to\Nbid farewell to the others.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.54,0:07:23.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I brought you some more tea.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.16,0:07:29.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you're the\Nshipwright for your vessel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:31.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.21,0:07:34.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, not really.\NActually, I'm a sniper.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.09,0:07:35.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow. That sounds exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:36.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.07,0:07:39.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it means we don't have a\Nregular shipwright in our crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.70,0:07:43.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's see, how can I\Nput this delicately?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.12,0:07:45.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am cursed with supreme\Nskill on every subject
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.50,0:07:47.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and the whole crew relies on me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.48,0:07:50.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a lotta work,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.98,0:07:54.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but without me the ship\Njust wouldn't function.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.78,0:07:56.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My official title\Nis Sharpshooter,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.74,0:07:59.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I'm also the co-captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.03,0:08:04.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that's why everyone\Ncalls me Captain... Usopp
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ooh, your color arrangement
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.12,0:08:08.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,clearly denotes the work\Nof a professional.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.41,0:08:09.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.62,0:08:12.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I consider the plating\Nof food an art form.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.90,0:08:14.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Naw, that doesn't work.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.36,0:08:15.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Throws off the\Nwhole arrangement.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.90,0:08:17.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I put the red one here
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.40,0:08:20.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and then the emerald green\Nbroad beans across the back...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.28,0:08:23.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Ah, now this\Nlooks delicious.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.74,0:08:26.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I sure hope Nami and Robin\Nappreciate the hard work.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.49,0:08:28.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow! It doesn't even\Nlook like food.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.75,0:08:29.75,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I've never seen such
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.83,0:08:31.75,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}a beautifully prepared\Nlunch before.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.83,0:08:33.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.17,0:08:34.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I made one for you as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.02,0:08:37.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really? Custom made just for me?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.73,0:08:39.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've prepared all the food today
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.15,0:08:40.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,according to a\Ntheme I've chosen.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.01,0:08:43.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I call it: "Love is a\NCruel Mistress Feast
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.30,0:08:44.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for a Fallen Angel."
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.63,0:08:45.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.55,0:08:47.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't get what\Nall the fuss is.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.68,0:08:49.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just a box lunch.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.78,0:08:53.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you trash my work!\NYou better watch your mouth!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.93,0:08:56.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A great meal starts with\Ngreat presentation!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.14,0:08:58.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why bother?\NIt all comes out the same.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.65,0:09:00.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're stuffing your\Nface without even looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.59,0:09:03.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and...?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.30,0:09:05.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why're you so mad?\NIt still tastes good.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.47,0:09:08.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause food should please your\Neyes as well as your palate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:09.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just stupid.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.78,0:09:13.40,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Not even I can eat with my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.40,0:09:15.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.99,0:09:17.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong with the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.37,0:09:18.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.45,0:09:20.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.91,0:09:22.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take a look! She just started\Nrockin' all of a sudden!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.02,0:09:24.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.23,0:09:26.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hope they're not havin'\Na party without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:29.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look. It's Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.71,0:09:35.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait. Why in the world\Nis she wearing a t-shirt?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.17,0:09:38.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure we have more\Npressing concerns right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.76,0:09:41.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys, look! The ship\Nstarted moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:43.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.75,0:09:46.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't just leave\Nus here, would they?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.51,0:09:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever seen a\Nship sailing backwards before.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.56,0:09:54.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But they haven't even\Nset the sails yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.27,0:09:55.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.73,0:09:58.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's something underneath!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.07,0:10:04.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think we're being\Ndragged away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:06.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But by what?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.55,0:10:09.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It must be...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.81,0:10:13.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the legendary\NWhite White Sea
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.68,0:10:16.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Super-Express Lobster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.59,0:10:21.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys, we're being hijacked!\NWe'll have to abandon ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.09,0:10:24.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, we've gotta move right\Nnow! While we still have time!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.39,0:10:25.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't leave the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.81,0:10:27.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Without it we won't be\Nable to get back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:30.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then I'll stay behind!\NJust go now!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.94,0:10:34.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forget it! You can't defend\Nthe whole ship by yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.73,0:10:36.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:54.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right. Makin' progress.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.93,0:10:57.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think\Nthat'll get you anywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.43,0:11:01.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come back on board.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.48,0:11:02.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.85,0:11:04.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll never be able\Nto significantly damage
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:06.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that creature, and we've got\Nbigger problems now. Look.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.02,0:11:08.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A school of vicious sky fish
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:17.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are following us\Nready to attack.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.11,0:11:20.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't jump ship\Nand escape now.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.95,0:11:22.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if we manage to\Ndefeat the sky fish,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.09,0:11:26.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that more will\Narrive to take their place.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.08,0:11:28.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our punishment has\Nalready begun.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.46,0:11:30.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And there's no way to stop it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.21,0:11:32.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heaven's Judgment.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.10,0:11:34.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They must be taking us\Nto the forbidden island.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.84,0:11:36.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess they got tired of waiting.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.77,0:11:39.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru's really got it in for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.48,0:11:43.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Please.\NI can't go back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.99,0:11:48.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy. Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji, Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.58,0:12:12.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why, Nami? Why a t-shirt?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.18,0:12:13.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're still thinking of that?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.99,0:12:15.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is awful, Luffy!\NWhat are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.62,0:12:18.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to rescue\NNami and the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:19.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.37,0:12:21.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder...\NWhere're they're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:24.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where're they're\Ngoing? Yes, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.00,0:12:26.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I got nothin'.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.71,0:12:28.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Um, well.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.22,0:12:29.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:32.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh. Uh...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.39,0:12:35.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Super-Express Lobster\Nis a messenger of Eneru.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.18,0:12:39.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He must be taking your friends\Nas a sacrificial offering.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.21,0:12:40.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If that's the case,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.94,0:12:42.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they are being taken to\Nthe northeast Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.04,0:12:45.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To the sacrificial altar.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.03,0:12:47.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.41,0:12:49.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't mean that Nami\Nand Robin and the rest...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.52,0:12:50.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rest?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.53,0:12:52.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...are gonna be sacrificed?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.52,0:12:54.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To that wannabe God?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.42,0:12:55.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.99,0:13:00.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He better not harm a single hair\Non my Nami's pretty head!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.31,0:13:01.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But listen carefully,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.77,0:13:04.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because I have not yet told\Nyou what else will happen.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.81,0:13:05.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? There's more?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.94,0:13:07.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, in Heaven's Judgment
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.07,0:13:10.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there are actually two different\Ntypes of criminal punishment
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.03,0:13:13.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I've only told\Nyou about the first.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.03,0:13:16.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The second punishment\Nis a challenge.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.20,0:13:19.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your friends are currently\Nhostages in Eneru's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.41,0:13:22.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And they are being taken\Nto him even as we speak.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.16,0:13:24.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hostages?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.02,0:13:26.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I must tell you,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.44,0:13:29.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the criminals who are\Nto receive the judgement
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.21,0:13:32.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are the three of you\Nstanding before me.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.69,0:13:35.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait. What are you\Ntrying to say?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.15,0:13:36.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we only had a map.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.74,0:13:41.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh. I know I've got one\Nof Skypiea with me somewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.16,0:13:43.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, this one is very old,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.12,0:13:44.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but it looks like the general\Nshape of the island
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.04,0:13:46.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is correctly rendered.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.46,0:13:49.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is where we are now.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.34,0:13:51.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sacrificial altar where\Nyour friends are headed
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.76,0:13:54.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is located a good distance\Nto the northeast,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.30,0:13:55.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,here in the Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.05,0:13:59.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'm afraid there's only\None way to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.56,0:14:03.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to take the Milky Road
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.18,0:14:05.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that leaves this island.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.27,0:14:07.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And your only means\Nof transportation
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.15,0:14:08.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will be the waver.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.97,0:14:11.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The road will take you\Nto a great forest
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.61,0:14:14.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,where the Priests are\Nawaiting your arrival.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.82,0:14:20.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.52,0:14:22.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a better way\Nfor us to get there unnoticed.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.94,0:14:24.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we just ride up\Nto the front gate,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.54,0:14:25.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we won't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.09,0:14:28.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Couldn't we sneak\Naround the side?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.17,0:14:29.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.01,0:14:31.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we take the main road,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.05,0:14:33.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they'll see us coming\Nand set a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:34.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That may be
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.67,0:14:36.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but even if you do\Nfind your way ashore,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.79,0:14:40.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there's no way that you'll ever\Nmake it to the altar on foot.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.37,0:14:43.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, your old map differs\Nfrom the current configuration
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.50,0:14:48.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in that now the Milky Roads\Ncriss-cross the entire island.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.37,0:14:50.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The cloud canals you mentioned.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.08,0:14:51.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:52.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are hundreds\Nof them, of all sizes,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.58,0:14:53.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,running every which way.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.05,0:14:56.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone really\Nknows where they all lead.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.56,0:14:58.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm. I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.14,0:15:00.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why your only course\Nof action is as I've said.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.90,0:15:03.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must follow the main\NMilky Road to the island,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.44,0:15:06.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and from there continue\Nuntil you reach the altar.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.31,0:15:08.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.31,0:15:10.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And even if we do find\Nanother way ashore,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.31,0:15:12.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the canals will block us\Nfrom continuing inland.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.62,0:15:14.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.19,0:15:17.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did I mention the man-eating\Nfish that prowl the canal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:18.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geh. Man-eating fish?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.98,0:15:21.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they've\Ncovered all their bases.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.31,0:15:25.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you're saying, if we want\Nour friends and ship back,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.82,0:15:28.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we have to walk right up\Nto their front door
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.86,0:15:30.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and march on it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.41,0:15:34.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is part of the\Nchallenge you mentioned?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.16,0:15:35.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Part of Heaven's Judgment?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.01,0:15:37.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.26,0:15:39.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In Upper Yard, there are\Nfour powerful Priests
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.18,0:15:41.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of unimaginable strength\Nwho await you.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.81,0:15:47.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Sounds like\Na piece of cake.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.69,0:15:50.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, all we have to do\Nto get our friends back
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.44,0:15:52.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is beat up these Priests, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.61,0:15:54.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You make it sound easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.16,0:16:00.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Finally, a little action!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.46,0:16:23.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow! This place is great!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.26,0:16:25.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lovely Street is\Nthe center of commerce
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.26,0:16:26.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on the Island.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.19,0:16:26.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It has everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.01,0:16:31.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Check it out! Floating stores!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.02,0:16:33.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It takes a special\Nvariety of island cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:35.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to build those.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.40,0:16:38.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So where's all the\Nfloating restaurants?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:52.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys. I notice everyone's\Navoiding us. Again.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.89,0:16:54.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't say I blame 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:56.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Word's probably already gotten\Nout that we're criminals.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.68,0:16:58.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what else is new?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.01,0:17:01.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, let 'em be that way!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.97,0:17:05.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That means we've got\Ndowntown all to ourselves!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.56,0:17:08.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All these gorgeous angels\Nand they're avoiding me.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.03,0:17:10.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.24,0:17:12.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure is a lot of weird\Nstuff for sale here.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.45,0:17:17.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw, man. Too bad\NI don't have any money.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.04,0:17:20.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister, do you\Ntake treasure?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.76,0:17:23.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, when you're\Ndone foolin' around,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.59,0:17:25.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there's still the matter of\Nrescuing Nami and the others.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.72,0:17:27.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you don't get\Nserious, and soon,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.55,0:17:29.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they're gonna be sacrificed,\Ndo you know that?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You worry too much!\NThey're fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.98,0:17:33.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, Zoro's with them!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.85,0:17:35.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like we can really\Ncount on that guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.83,0:17:38.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just hope the ship hasn't\Nsustained any more damage.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.13,0:17:41.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, she's had more than\Nher share of abuse lately.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.17,0:17:43.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh. There's something\Nin the middle of the street!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:44.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.97,0:17:51.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a weird face!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.43,0:17:53.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's it supposed\Nto be? A seal?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.31,0:17:55.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like a figure\Nmade outta mud.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.14,0:17:57.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Knowing this place, I bet it's\Nsome kinda religious statue.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're both morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:01.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is art! I can tell!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.14,0:18:02.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is "vearth."
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.81,0:18:04.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You might say it represents
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.52,0:18:07.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the eternal yearnings of\Nthe people of the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.40,0:18:08.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vearth, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.40,0:18:09.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.65,0:18:12.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what, you guys like,\Npray to this thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.45,0:18:14.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's pretty crazy.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.59,0:18:19.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it would\Nbe difficult for someone
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.18,0:18:20.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from the Blue Sea to understand.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.16,0:18:23.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! We're almost to\Nthe docks! Right this way!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.46,0:18:25.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw! We're leavin' town already?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.34,0:18:26.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Already?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.42,0:18:27.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were never planning\Non stopping here
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.84,0:18:29.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the first place!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.09,0:18:30.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know, but I don't see why
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.54,0:18:32.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we couldn't stick around\Na little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.96,0:18:38.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Phew! Looks like it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.84,0:18:40.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're\Nheaded straight for the docks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.59,0:18:41.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.78,0:19:03.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at all these boats!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.70,0:19:04.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, you'll notice\Nthere are boats
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.99,0:19:07.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of all shapes and sizes\Nanchored in this harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.49,0:19:12.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you look over here,\Nthere are even more types.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.25,0:19:13.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.21,0:19:15.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That one! It's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:21.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I always wanted a\Ngondola! We'll take it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.72,0:19:23.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Look back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.26,0:19:25.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I bet those dials make this baby\Nmove quicker than lightning!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.97,0:19:27.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be\Na whole lotta fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.64,0:19:29.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on! Let's go for a spin!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.33,0:19:30.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.58,0:19:32.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've got to rescue the\Ncrew first, remember?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.08,0:19:34.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get serious, will ya?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.45,0:19:36.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Actually, your boat\Nis right over here.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.54,0:19:37.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:38.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.04,0:19:40.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it even awesomer\Nthan the gondola?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.92,0:19:43.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I can't wait to see it.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.26,0:19:55.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Presenting: The Crow!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.06,0:19:59.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! You're kidding me, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.56,0:20:04.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, uh, crows don't even swim.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.61,0:20:06.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I only learned\Nto ride a waver recently.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.98,0:20:09.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Before then, I used the\NCrow to get around.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.15,0:20:11.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not as fast as\Na waver of course,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.11,0:20:14.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but it has two Breath Dials,\Nand is quite reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:16.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, feel free to use it.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.79,0:20:19.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait. I'm not going.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.49,0:20:21.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.70,0:20:23.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew he'd finally\Nshow his true colors.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.26,0:20:26.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unless I can take that.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.60,0:20:32.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's not scared; he's selfish.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.10,0:20:37.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That one, huh?\NYou don't like the Crow?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.65,0:20:39.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.15,0:20:40.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only thing sorry is this\Nguy! Apologize, you ingrate!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.89,0:20:42.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She goes to the trouble\Nof getting us a boat
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.60,0:20:43.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and all you do is complain!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.81,0:20:45.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.35,0:20:47.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry he doesn't appreciate\Nyour help like I do, Conis.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.94,0:20:49.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.13,0:20:52.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your exit is Gate Number Two.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.88,0:20:54.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It leads right to\Nthe Milky Road,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.59,0:20:58.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and that will take you all\Nthe way to Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.18,0:21:01.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just... Just follow it\Nand you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.00,0:21:05.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Conis.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.40,0:21:07.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.69,0:21:09.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've been trembling\Never since we left.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.80,0:21:11.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.38,0:21:16.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ugh. Can't hear.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.43,0:21:18.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're they talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.49,0:21:22.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-Is it that noticeable?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.55,0:21:26.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's like you're\Nscared or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.60,0:21:32.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, wait. She wouldn't!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.28,0:21:34.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?\NShe's worried about us!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.95,0:21:38.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, Conis, that is so\Nsweet of you, my dear!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.08,0:21:42.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Speaking of being worried,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.79,0:21:45.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are you and Pagaya\Ngonna be all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.13,0:21:47.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, everyone in town\Nis avoiding us like the plague,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.59,0:21:49.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but you're leading us around,\Nlending us your boat,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.78,0:21:51.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,giving us directions.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.51,0:21:54.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is helping us gonna\Nget you in trouble?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.46,0:21:57.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that make you,\Nlike, our accomplices?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.41,0:22:02.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis, don't cry.\NYou'll gonna be fine, 'kay?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.67,0:22:06.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should've told us\Nyou were scared.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.29,0:22:08.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really. We could have just\Ncome here on our own.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.34,0:22:09.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.88,0:22:11.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.13,0:22:14.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not what you think!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.28,0:22:18.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.62,0:22:21.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't say anything\Nyou'll regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.93,0:22:25.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.18,0:22:27.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even after I told you how\Nterrifying Upper Yard is,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.77,0:22:29.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I still led you here.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.39,0:22:31.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I even got you a boat and\Ntold you which route to take.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.05,0:22:33.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you find that odd?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.51,0:22:36.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious\Nwhat's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.80,0:22:41.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Watch your tongue, little girl!\NDon't say anything foolish!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.77,0:22:43.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? You hear somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.44,0:22:51.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.02,0:22:56.86,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me\Nthey're all in on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.78,0:23:01.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, Conis, please forgive me.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.78,0:23:03.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it's every citizen's duty.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.03,0:23:05.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know what will happen
Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.20,0:23:08.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if we don't follow\Nalmighty Eneru's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.55,0:23:18.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just run away. Please.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.51,0:23:24.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.86,0:23:28.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, no, stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.07,0:23:30.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.07,0:23:33.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I called the Super\NExpress Lobster.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.61,0:23:36.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was all my fault!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.54,0:23:39.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean that thing that took\NNami and the others away?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.34,0:23:40.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You called it, Conis?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.79,0:23:46.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,While you three were\Ninside talking to my father,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.96,0:23:49.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I went aboard and lied to\Nyour friends about a current
Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.37,0:23:51.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that leads to Cloud End.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.64,0:23:53.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They believed me.\NAnd I had them raise anchor.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.27,0:24:01.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was the signal that\Nsummoned almighty Eneru's
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.74,0:24:03.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Super Express Lobster.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.85,0:24:14.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Do you want to die?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.92,0:24:16.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You stupid girl!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.75,0:24:18.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once we know\Nsomeone's a criminal,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.10,0:24:19.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we must lead them to Upper Yard!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.08,0:24:23.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we don't, then\Nthe penalty is death!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.64,0:24:26.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:26.85,0:24:29.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna bring his\Nwrath down upon us all!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.41,0:24:30.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.51,0:24:32.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Somebody stop her!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.37,0:24:35.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's our duty.\NThe duty of every citizen.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.50,0:24:36.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.92,0:24:38.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.54,0:24:43.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry. I should've\Ntold you sooner.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.21,0:24:44.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.59,0:24:48.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're saying they forced\Nyou to lead us all here?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.26,0:24:53.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If that's true...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.56,0:24:58.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– ...then why even tell us at all?!\N– ...then why even tell us at all?!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.40,0:25:04.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?\NNow your life is in danger!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.63,0:25:06.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.17,0:25:07.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're too late!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.53,0:25:08.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get away from the girl!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.99,0:25:11.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The judgment is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.72,0:25:48.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's too big!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.43,0:26:36.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What in the\Nworld was that thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.38,0:26:38.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It did that?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.76,0:26:39.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.62,0:26:41.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.58,0:26:43.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.12,0:26:45.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Conis!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.58,0:26:46.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.74,0:26:47.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what happens to those
Dialogue: 50,0:26:47.75,0:26:50.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who defy almighty Eneru!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.13,0:26:56.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do not fear.\NThey are both safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.68,0:27:02.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pi-e!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.66,0:27:04.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's him! Gan Fall!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.64,0:27:08.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! The weird old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.70,0:27:10.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me, "weird"? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.08,0:27:14.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am the Sky Knight, friend.\NAnd this one's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.59,0:27:21.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis! Look she's safe!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:21.78,0:27:24.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And she will\Nremain so under my watch.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.12,0:27:28.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have my word. I shant\Nallow Eneru to harm her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.47,0:27:29.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.98,0:27:34.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that you've seen the scope\Nof Eneru's power and anger,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.98,0:27:37.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what are you going to do next?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.14,0:27:40.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The same thing we were\Ngonna do from the start.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.46,0:27:43.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go to Upper Yard and\Nrescue our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.66,0:27:46.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see. May luck be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.96,0:27:49.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pi-e!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.44,0:27:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What about them?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.40,0:27:59.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They have chosen\Ntheir own course.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.10,0:28:03.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do not blame yourself, child.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.35,0:28:06.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-I know who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.02,0:28:09.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course! It's no secret.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.24,0:28:10.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am the Sky Knight.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.41,0:28:13.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. We-We all know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.45,0:28:17.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please come back to us... God.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.48,0:28:23.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good luck, fellas!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.89,0:28:26.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hop aboard. Get comfy.\NI'll give you good shove off!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.73,0:28:27.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get on the boat!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.86,0:28:29.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.87,0:28:36.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, Upper Yard,\Nhere we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.04,0:28:41.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.17,0:28:46.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They-They went.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.46,0:28:49.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Without any fear or hesitation!
